  "epistemic_guardrails": [
    "This packet grounds contemporaneous capacity expectations, supplier-reported outcomes, demand commentary, technology-transition observations and management guidance only. It does not create a causal coefficient or select one hindsight narrative for the 2017 upcycle.",
    "Rising DRAM or NAND prices are market outcomes. Price strength alone is not Evidence of supplier coordination, collusion or deliberate industry-wide withholding.",
    "TrendForce December 2016 DRAM/NAND wafer-capacity statements are forecasts for 2017 and must remain industry expectations until a comparable realized capacity measurement is recovered.",
    "The September 2017 NAND transition-capacity-loss observation is later-known within the 2017 trajectory and must not appear in an April 2017 replay.",
    "DRAM and NAND tightened through partially different mechanisms. DRAM wafer-capacity expectations must not be used as a proxy for NAND transition losses, and NAND transition evidence must not be projected onto DRAM.",
    "SK hynix quarterly shipment and ASP changes are primary only for SK hynix. They do not establish industry-wide supply discipline or causality.",
    "Samsung server/mobile demand commentary is a supplier self-statement about demand conditions, not an independent industry bit-demand measurement.",
    "Micron's no-new-wafer-capacity statement is fiscal-2018 management guidance for Micron's own plan and must not be generalized to competitors or backdated as a realized 2017 industry outcome.",
    "Grounding creates EvidenceFragments only. Counterfactual assessment remains research-only unless later source-grounded Facts/Judgments justify separate projection."
  ],
